      "sourceTextSha256": "bad314216bb40140799fed8c37a06943e72a6e694413362242a93a2e843f4162",
      "text": "07:30  ·  Breakfast and departure\n\nTravel to INTA Balcarce.\n\n09:30  ·  Lectures at INTA Balcarce\n\nTopics include no-till farming on heavy black soils; grain storage in plastic silo bags; stored-grain quality management; and remote monitoring equipment.",
