      "text": "13:00–14:00  ·  Lunch\n\n15:00–19:00  ·  Visit to an agricultural and seed-potato producer\n\nExamine farming on heavy clay soils and challenging terrain, including soybeans, sorghum, sunflower, maize, wheat and potatoes.\n\n20:00  ·  Return to the hotel\n\n20:30  ·  Dinner\n\nRoute: Approx. 230 km   |   Overnight: Mar del Plata",
